sections.text:
Boosts Disorder damage, inflicts Disorder on her own regardless of Anomaly Buildup;

 Able to apply Anomaly effectively in quick, short bursts but also in a more sustained on-field playstyle — very flexible gameplay-wise;

 Doesn't mind lower investments as much as other characters due to being able to be used as a disorder bot within a Miyabi team, has good F2P W-Engine choices and having most skills unlevelled is okay;

 Has lots of team options available by extension of her playstyle fiexibility.
